# --- Served-path data-file guard (added 2026-08-20, PII exposure incident) ---
# Never commit client-data / bulk-data files into web-served paths. Repos are
# private again, but files under public/ and dist/ are downloadable from the
# live site once built. Exemptions below are the only intended-public documents.
public/*.xlsx
public/*.xls
public/*.csv
public/*.sql
public/*.pdf
public/*.docx
dist/*.xlsx
dist/*.xls
dist/*.csv
dist/*.sql
dist/*.pdf
dist/*.docx
!public/Privacy Policy.pdf
!public/terms and conditions.pdf
